# Visual identity lock (Utility Cube) — NON-NÉGOCIABLE

This lock applies to **every** future screen, module, gate, widget, and PR.  
No parallel design system. No “temporary” alternate chrome.

## Before any UI work

1. Read `apps/web/src/app/globals.css` (`--a-*` tokens only).
2. Reuse `AppShell` + `AScreenHeader` + `A*` / `ADrawer` / `ABadge` / `AButton`.
3. Match reference pixels: `/` · `/preview/lots` · `/preview/commandes` · `/sales` · `/delivery` · `/settings`.
4. If a screen diverges → **fix that screen**, never invent a second look.

