## Chrome (mandatory)

- Sidebar sobré ~232px: icons + labels, **13px `font-normal`**, thin stroke icons, mint active on parent only, green **dot** on active leaf
- Topbar: centered search ⌘K, notif, profil
- Page: breadcrumbs → `AScreenHeader` (title medium, one primary CTA right) → filters → table/form → optional right `ADrawer`
- Status = pastel pill `ABadge` only
- Gates `/dev/*` = `ADevPage` only
- Montants TND / stock = solid tabular (never blur the digits)

## Forbidden

- Second sidebar / topbar / “module skin”
- Near-black greens (`#005040`, `#0f6b3f`, `#125b4a`) for CTAs — use `#059669`
- IBM Plex / Geist as product UI fonts (superseded)
- Promo “Discover Pro Plan” / decorative SPECTRE card in sidebar
- Raw hex in `components/` (tokens only)
- New typography scale fighting the 13px nav / soft headers

## New modules

Every business module ships **inside** this shell with the same density, badges, buttons, and drawer patterns. Ask before changing tokens.
